ey_answer": null}, {"n": 12, "text": "The marked price of a chair was ₹1,000 but it was sold for ₹1,200. What is the percentage increase on the product?", "options": [{"text": "10%", "added": false}, {"text": "15%", "added": false}, {"text": "35%", "added": false}, {"text": "20%", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Discount", "sub": "single-discount", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 13, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "0", "added": false}, {"text": "−1", "added": false}, {"text": "2", "added": false}, {"text": "1", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Algebra", "sub": "identities", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 14, "text": "A gives B a head-start of 10 seconds in a 1500 m race and both finish the race at the same time. What is the time taken by A (in minutes) to finish the race if speed of B is 6 m/s?", "options": [{"text": "3", "added": false}, {"text": "4", "added": false}, {"text": "8", "added": false}, {"text": "5", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Time-Speed-Distance", "sub": "basic-tsd", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 15, "text": "Arrange the given ratios in descending order 15 : 7, 5 : 11 and 21 : 77.", "options": [{"text": "21 : 77 > 5 : 11 > 15 : 7", "added": false}, {"text": "15 : 7 > 5 : 11 > 21 : 77", "added": false}, {"text": "15 : 7 > 21 : 77 > 5 : 11", "added": false}, {"text": "5 : 11 > 15 : 7 > 21 : 77", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Ratio-Proportion", "sub": "ratio-basics", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 16, "text": "In an assembly election, a candidate got 60% of the total valid votes. 2% of the total votes were declared invalid. If the total number of voters is 1,50,000, then find the number of valid votes polled in favour of that candidate.", "options": [{"text": "90,000", "added": false}, {"text": "78,000", "added": false}, {"text": "86,400", "added": false}, {"text": "88,200", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Percentage", "sub": "basic-percentage", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 17, "text": "A six-digit number 763254 is divisible by 18. If we subtract five times of 41 from the number, then the new number which is formed will be divisible by:", "options": [{"text": "2", "added": false}, {"text": "7", "added": false}, {"text": "5", "added": false}, {"text": "3", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Number System", "sub": "divisibility-rules", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 18, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "540", "added": false}, {"text": "560", "added": false}, {"text": "740", "added": false}, {"text": "760", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Data Interpretation", "sub": "pie-chart", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 19, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "bodmas", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 20, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "24 cm", "added": false}, {"text": "32 cm", "added": false}, {"text": "8 cm", "added": false}, {"text": "16 cm", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Geometry", "sub": "congruence-and-similarity", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 21, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "HCF-LCM", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 22, "text": "A hemispherical bowl of internal diameter 18 cm contains water. This water is to be filled in cylindrical bottles of diameter 6cm and height 3 cm. The number of bottles required to empty the bowl is:", "options": [{"text": "3", "added": false}, {"text": "9", "added": false}, {"text": "6", "added": false}, {"text": "18", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Mensuration 3D", "sub": "conversion-and-melting", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 23, "text": "A retailer offers the following discount schemes for buyers on an 